  "description": "The 12-inch Barbie Girls Bike by Dynacraft is bringing all the fashionable Malibu vibes. The Barbie friend group runs deep, so your little one will feel like part of the crew as she rides this beautiful bike featuring Barbie and her friends on the frame and handlebar pad. With a chic, iridescent handlebar bag, she can store her favorite accessories and ride confidently around the neighborhood. The classic “Barbie Pink,” yellow, and blue details make for an enticing color combo; while the inspirational catchphrase, “Own Your Unique” printed throughout the bike keeps young riders feeling self-assured. The vibrant, stylish designs featured throughout the frame, chain guard, and training wheels add some extra fun to this trendy children’s bike. Accessible features such as easy-to-control coaster brakes and an adjustable seat post make this a great option for kids just learning to ride. Live fabulously like Barbie on the 12-inch Barbie Girls Bike!",
